# Every test runs under this repository's wrapper: its own short TMPDIR under /tmp, removed when it
# ends (macOS caps a unix socket path at 104 bytes, and Bazel's TEST_TMPDIR is too long for the daemon's
# sockets and sits in the execroot, which links the checkout's .git), and the guard that refuses every
# program the test does not
# declare. A user bazelrc that sets another --run_under imports this file as its last line
# (docs/running-tests.md).
test --run_under=//tools:test_tmpdir
